<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telerj Jan-May net 36.1 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telerj Jan-May net 36.1 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal telecommunications company Telerj, a unit of the federal Telebras system, on Wednesday released the following preliminary consolidated financial results for the January-May period.</p>
<p>				Jan-May 1997</p>
<p>    Net			 36.101 million</p>
<p>    Gross revenues	  735.928 million</p>
<p>Net operating revenue 555.129 million</p>
<p>    Operating profit	52.434 million</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	   49.613 million</p>
<p>Note: figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its net worth totaled 2.621 bln reais in the January-May period.</p>
<p>It also said consolidated installed fixed lines reached 1.901 million while cellular terminals totaled 168,000 in the period.</p>
<p>(( -- Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5410))</p>
